        {
          "id": "a34d6aaa-832e-3347-b086-6f75883f9b1a",
          "content": {
            "id": "a34d6aaa-832e-3347-b086-6f75883f9b1a",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Trump's 100% film tariff: What this means for the movie industry",
            "description": "<p>Shares of major media companies, like Disney (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/DIS\">DIS</a>), Paramount Global (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PARA\">PARA</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PARAA\">PARAA</a>), Netflix (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NFLX\">NFLX</a>), and Warner Bros. Discovery (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/WBD\">WBD</a>), are ticking lower into the red on Monday as President Trump <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/netflix-disney-stocks-slide-as-trump-threatens-100-tariff-on-foreign-made-films-132449339.html\">considers levying a 100% tariff against foreign-produced films.</a></p>\n<p>Yahoo Finance Senior Media Reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/alexandra-canal/\">Allie Canal</a> comes on Market Domination to discuss the situation, President Trump's comments, and the severe impacts these tariffs <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/preventing-hollywoods-very-fast-death-could-become-trumps-9th-national-emergency-151634751.html\">could have on Hollywood and the greater entertainment industry.</a></p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Market Domination\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">here</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Shares of major media companies, like Disney (DIS), Paramount Global (PARA, PARAA), Netflix (NFLX), and Warner Bros. Discovery (WBD), are ticking lower into the red on Monday as President Trump considers levying a 100% tariff against foreign-produced films. Yahoo Finance Senior Media Reporter Allie Canal comes on Market Domination to discuss the situation, President Trump's comments, and the severe impacts these tariffs could have on Hollywood and the greater entertainment industry. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Market Domination&nbsp;here.",
